?oc=5) put crypto liquidations above $500 million.\n\nThis is not a clean safe-haven bid for Bitcoin. Right now, BTC is trading like a high-beta risk asset.\n\n## Fixed-income outflows and crypto liquidations: What bitcoin liquidation shows\n\n\n[87 more lines in file. Use offset=21 to continue.][... 7872 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779085311917},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callFZAxsi799Ta29l3FUMM7ZRy1","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n[1m[38;5;209m🦞 OpenClaw[39m[22m [38;5;216m2026.4.23[39m [38;5;138m(a979721)[39m [38;5;138m—[39m [38;5;167mI don't judge, but your missing API keys are absolutely judging you.[39m\n\n[?25l[90m│[39m\n[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m[1G[J[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m.[1G[J[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◒[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◐[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◓[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for agent reply…[39m..[1G[J[35m◑[39m  [38;5;209mWaiting for age