sh BTC leveraged positions, the war in Iran and fear of an economic crisis.\\n\\nGoogle News result summary: Bloomberg headline says Bitcoin (BTC) hit a two-week low as crypto liquidations topped half a billion. That corroborates the same-day selloff and shows the move was large enough to force significant leveraged positions out of the market.\"\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":7331,"output":1930,"cacheRead":23040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32301,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779084999357,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DglZKpaYaIDNs2FpofgHd8VfPBB2N"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callBgnqOScepeCwXIzwsZJZzErx","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 5636 bytes to /tmp/research.json"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779085026281},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call5ruzmdQxc2rDLbu0XNVT3OEN","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/writer/sessions/sessions.json\nRESEARCH_JSON=$(cat /tmp/research.json)\nopenclaw agent --agent writer --message \"First, read the COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md file in your workspace to learn your strict formatting rules. Then, write a 1100-1200 word crypto news article using these facts: $RESEARCH_JSON. You MUST finish the article completely, ending with the Sources and Word Count block.\" --deliver > /tmp/crypto-article.md\n\nsed -i '/<thinking>/,/<\\/thinking>/d' /tmp/crypto-article.md\n\nif ! grep -qi \"Word Count:\" /tmp/crypto-article.md; then\n  echo \"Article incomplete. Forcing recovery run...\"\n  rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/writer/sessions/sessions.json\n  openclaw agent --agent writer --message \"Your previous attempt was cut off. Re-read COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md and write a tighter article using these facts: $RESEARCH_JSON. You MUST reach the final Word Count block.\" --deliver > /tmp/crypto-article.md\n  sed -i '/<thinking>/